      "short_description": "Seasonal open-air amphitheater near Kansas City hosting rock concerts, festivals and events with reserved, VIP and lawn seating for up to 18,000.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": null,
      "overall_description": "Azura Amphitheater is a premier seasonal open-air venue located near Kansas City, known for hosting major rock concerts, festivals, and community events. With a capacity of up to 18,000, it offers a variety of seating experiences ranging from VIP and reserved sections to an expansive general admission lawn. The venue is a hub for music enthusiasts, providing an energetic atmosphere for summer entertainment in a spacious outdoor setting.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is energetic and communal, particularly during high-profile concerts and festivals where music fans gather under the open sky. It provides a quintessential summer concert vibe characterized by a social, outdoor experience.",
      "amenities_description": "The venue provides tiered seating options including reserved, VIP, and general admission lawn areas, complemented by on-site food and beverage vendors and dedicated security personnel.",
      "unique_selling_points": "As the largest open-air amphitheater in the Kansas City area, it offers a distinct, high-capacity summer concert experience. The venue is particularly noted for its expansive lawn and its ability to host major national touring acts and festivals.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The venue is located in a quiet, sprawling area of Bonner Springs that provides a natural, open-air backdrop for large-scale outdoor events.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Azura Amphitheater is a seasonal, open-air venue situated in a spacious rural setting just west of Kansas City. It features a large sloping lawn and reserved seating areas designed to accommodate thousands of guests.",
